---
import ExFrame from './ExFrame.astro';
import Tag from './Tag.astro';
import Lines from './Lines.astro';

// Booklet p.1.22 · Component 1 closing: Synthesis (filled example).
interface Props {
  alt: string;
  caption: string;
}
const { alt, caption } = Astro.props;

const oneLine = [
  ['Media', 'Promises “one place, seamless”.'],
  ['Gossip', 'Nobody can tell you where your application is.'],
  ['History', 'You can no longer plead your case to a person.'],
  ['Power', 'It only works because of unpaid helpers.'],
  ['Villain ★', 'No way to make a PDF on a phone (8/10).'],
];
const redesigns = [
  ['A', 'Photo-to-PDF inside the upload step'],
  ['B', 'An error that says how to fix the file'],
  ['C', 'OTP to a number the student chooses'],
];
---

<ExFrame page="1.22" alt={alt} caption={caption}>
  <div class="sy">
    <p class="intro"><Lines lines={['Pull every story card back onto the table. Make them compete until one direction survives. Every', 'answer must point to a card.']} /></p>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <div class="hd"><h4>One line from each tool</h4><Tag>S8 One line × 5</Tag></div>
        <dl class="lines">
          {oneLine.map(([k, v]) => <div><dt class="lbl">{k}</dt><dd>{v}</dd></div>)}
        </dl>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <div class="hd"><h4>The sharpest contradiction</h4></div>
        <blockquote class="dark"><p><Lines lines={['“The product claims to be one seamless place, but the Villain Story revealed it needs a scanner, a', 'cybercafé and a father’s phone.”']} /></p></blockquote>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <div class="hd"><h4>Three candidate redesigns</h4><Tag>S8 Redesign A · B · C</Tag></div>
        <ul class="opts">
          {redesigns.map(([k, v]) => <li><b>{k}</b> {v}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
        <div class="hd"><h4>Test on the Blame Scale</h4><Tag>B7 · Lay A B C on the line</Tag></div>
        <p class="txt"><Lines lines={['A moves the blame furthest toward the system. C moves it some. B only explains the failure, so it’s set', 'aside.']} /></p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
        <div class="hd"><h4>Test on Power</h4></div>
        <p class="txt"><Lines lines={['“If A were built, students without scanners would gain a free way to submit. Cybercafés and agents', 'would resist it, because they’d lose paid work.”']} /></p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">6</span>
        <div class="hd"><h4>The finding</h4></div>
        <p class="txt"><Lines lines={['“This product assumes a scanner and a PDF, but the user actually has a phone camera, which causes', 'a paid trip, a lost day and self-blame.”']} /></p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">7</span>
        <div class="hd"><h4>The design claim</h4><Tag>S8 Claim</Tag></div>
        <blockquote class="claim">
          <p>
            “We should redesign <b>the document upload step</b>, because it would shift blame from<br class="b" />{' '}<b>“mujhe hi nahi pata tha”</b> to <b>the portal’s missing PDF path</b>, and would specifically help<br class="b" />{' '}<b>Meera, and students like her with only a phone</b>.”
          </p>
        </blockquote>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</ExFrame>

<style is:global>
  .sy {
    --bk-green-ink: #2e5e4e;
  }
  .sy .intro {
    color: #3f3a33;
    font-size: var(--t-lead);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 15;
    line-height: 1.47;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sy .steps {
    margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 12.5);
  }
  .sy .steps > li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: calc(var(--u) * 34.5) minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    align-content: start;
    padding: calc(var(--u) * 7.8) 0 calc(var(--u) * 7.9);
    border-top: calc(var(--u) * 0.7) solid #cfc8ba;
  }
  .sy .steps > li:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .sy .steps > li:first-child .n {
    top: calc(var(--u) * -3.7);
  }
  .sy .steps > li {
    position: relative;
  }
  .sy .n {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: calc(var(--u) * 4.1);
    color: var(--bk-green-ink);
    font-size: max(20px, calc(var(--u) * 18));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 24;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .sy .hd {
    grid-column: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: calc(var(--u) * 3) calc(var(--u) * 5.8);
  }
  .sy .hd h4 {
    font-size: var(--t-lead);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 15;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .sy .steps > li > :not(.n):not(.hd) {
    grid-column: 2;
  }
  .sy .lines {
    margin: calc(var(--u) * 1) 0 0;
    font-size: max(13px, calc(var(--u) * 9.8));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 13;
  }
  .sy .lines > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: calc(var(--u) * 73.5) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: baseline;
    min-height: calc(var(--u) * 15.4);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sy .lines dd {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .sy .lines .lbl {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: max(11px, calc(var(--u) * 7.1));
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .sy .dark,
  .sy .claim {
    margin: calc(var(--u) * 2.5) 0 0;
    border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 10);
    color: var(--bk-cream, #f5f0e6);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sy .dark {
    background: var(--bk-ink);
    padding: calc(var(--u) * 6.8) calc(var(--u) * 9) calc(var(--u) * 7.5);
    min-height: calc(var(--u) * 43.4);
    font-size: max(13px, calc(var(--u) * 10.1));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 13.5;
    line-height: 1.41;
  }
  .sy .claim {
    margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 3);
    background: var(--bk-green);
    padding: calc(var(--u) * 9.4) calc(var(--u) * 10.5) calc(var(--u) * 8.7);
    font-size: var(--t-lead);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 15;
    line-height: 1.47;
  }
  .sy .claim b {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .sy .opts {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: calc(var(--u) * 5.2);
    margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 3.2);
  }
  .sy .opts li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: calc(var(--u) * 2.5);
    height: calc(var(--u) * 19.5);
    min-height: 2em;
    padding: 0 calc(var(--u) * 7.1);
    background: #fff;
    border: calc(var(--u) * 0.75) solid var(--bk-ink);
    border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 7);
    font-size: max(13px, calc(var(--u) * 9.4));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 12.5;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sy .opts b {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .sy .txt {
    margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 3);
    font-size: max(13px, calc(var(--u) * 10.1));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 13.5;
    line-height: 1.41;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @container (max-width: 45rem) {
    .sy .intro,
    .sy .lines > div,
    .sy .dark,
    .sy .claim,
    .sy .opts li,
    .sy .txt {
      white-space: normal;
    }
    .sy .steps > li {
      grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding-block: var(--sp-2);
    }
    .sy .steps > li:first-child {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    .sy .n {
      top: calc(var(--sp-2) - 2px);
    }
    .sy .steps > li:first-child .n {
      top: -2px;
    }
    .sy .lines > div {
      grid-template-columns: 6.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding-block: 2px;
    }
    .sy .dark,
    .sy .claim {
      padding: var(--sp-2);
      border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    }
    .sy .opts li {
      height: auto;
      min-height: 2.25em;
      padding-block: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>
